  "title": "Tredegar Announces Bonnell Aluminum Leadership Changes",
  "summary": "RICHMOND, Va. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jun. 1, 2026-- Bonnell Aluminum, a subsidiary of Tredegar Corporation, today announced that Brook Hamilton, President of Bonnell Aluminum (“Bonnell”), will retire in July 2026 after more than two decades of leadership and service.",
